fore":"...阙。《史记》：周赧王二十四年，苏厉谓周君：秦将出塞攻梁。","source_end_index":210,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"cfbc913c-ec83-5422-91d0-d9def501db33","source_start_index":190,"source_text":"又秦昭王十四年，白起攻韩、魏之师于伊阙。"}],"path":"河南方舆纪要/二、河南府（卷四十八）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":["军事","人事"],"content":"1韓公孫喜、魏人伐秦。穰侯薦左更白起於秦王以代向壽將兵，敗魏師、韓師於伊闕，斬首二十四萬級，虜公孫喜，拔五城。秦王以白起爲國尉。","content_fanyi":"韩国公孙喜与魏国联合攻打秦国。秦国穰侯向秦昭襄王推荐左更白起接替向寿统兵，在伊阙击败魏军和韩军，斩首二十四万级，俘虏公孙喜，夺取五座城邑。秦昭襄王升任白起为国尉。","content_jianti_auto":"1韩公孙喜、魏人伐秦。穰侯荐左更白起于秦王以代向寿将兵，败魏师、韩师于伊阙，斩首二十四万级，虏公孙喜，拔五城。秦王以白起为国尉。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":317,"number":1,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8c9fb348-db0e-11ef-8a1e-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"飭，治也，整也。遺，于季翻。倍，蒲妹翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"饬，治也，整也。遗，于季翻。倍，蒲妹翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":29,"tongjian_id":"8ca0d67c-db0e-11ef-98cd-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"樂，音洛，快意也；言一戰以快其意。","note_content_jianti_auto":"乐，音洛，快意也；言一战以快其意。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":35,"tongjian_id":"8ca0d67d-db0e-11ef-b94f-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"和親者，結和以相親也。復，扶又翻，又音如字。","note_content_jianti_auto":"和亲者，结和以相亲也。复，扶又翻，又音如字。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":47,"tongjian_id":"8ca0d67e-db0e-11ef-a93d-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":-325,"link_death_year":-251,"link_td_description":"秦昭襄王，嬴姓，名稷，秦惠文王之子，秦悼武王之弟，战国时期秦国君主。","link_td_id":"Q10001807","link_td_number_id":176297,"people_name":"秦王","people_name_jianti_auto":"秦王","people_xingming":"嬴稷","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"8ca0d67f-db0e-11ef-a4dc-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[嬴稷]"},{"people_name":"楚王","people_name_jianti_auto":"楚王","people_xingming":"芈横","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"8ca0d680-db0e-11ef-8526-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[芈横]"},{"people_name":"楚王","people_name_jianti_auto":"楚王","people_xingming":"芈横","start_index":35,"tongjian_id":"8ca0d685-db0e-11ef-bf60-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[芈横]"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"楚","place_name_jianti_auto":"楚","resolved_place_entity_id":130,"start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"8ca0d681-db0e-11ef-947e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"秦","place_name_jianti_auto":"秦","resolved_place_entity_id":18,"start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"8ca0d682-db0e-11ef-afd8-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"秦","place_name_jianti_auto":"秦","resolved_place_entity_id":18,"start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"8ca0d683-db0e-11ef-846b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"楚","place_name_jianti_auto":"楚","resolved_place_entity_id":130,"start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"8ca0d684-db0e-11ef-8315-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"秦","place_name_jianti_auto":"秦","resolved_place_entity_id":18,"start_index":43,"tongjian_id":"8ca0d686-db0e-11ef-aac5-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["外交"],"content":"2秦王遺楚王書曰：「楚倍秦，秦且率諸侯伐楚，願王之飭士卒，得一樂戰！」楚王患之，乃復與秦和親。","content_fanyi":"秦昭襄王写信给楚顷襄王说：“楚国背弃了秦国，秦国就要统领诸侯各国攻伐楚国，请您整备军队，痛痛快快地打一仗！”楚顷襄王因而忧惧，便重新与秦国恢复和亲。","content_jianti_auto":"2秦王遗楚王书曰：「楚倍秦，秦且率诸侯伐楚，愿王之饬士卒，得一乐战！」楚王患之，乃复与秦和亲。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":318,"number":2